    {
      "id": null,
      "key": "panelPANE-5DD63B999D1AC849",
      "title": "Basic Metric Calculations",
      "visualSettings": "{\"general\":{\"mode\":\"TextPanel\",\"type\":\"text\",\"displayType\":\"default\",\"outlierBandColor\":\"#FDECF5\",\"outlierBandMarkerColor\":\"#ED3CPE\",\"outlierBandFillOpacity\":0.15,\"outlierBandLineThickness\":2,\"outlierBandMarkerSize\":10,\"outlierBandMarkerType\":\"triangle\"},\"text\":{\"format\":\"markdown\"},\"series\":{},\"title\":{\"fontSize\":14}}",
      "keepVisualSettingsConsistentWithParent": true,
      "panelType": "TextPanel",
      "text": "### Dropped Connection\nA dropped connection indicates Nginx ended the connection before finishing the request.\n\nDropped connections are calculated using the formula:\n\n`Accepted Connections - Handled Connections`\n\n### Requests per Second\n\nRequests per Second are requests served per second by Nginx. Requests per second are calculated using the formula:\n\n`Total Requests / Handled Connections`      "
    },
